        "
	REVISION "201009300000Z"	
	DESCRIPTION
      "Changes by D.Spreafico
	   The following objects  have been updated:
	    - added holdOver (3) value to opticsIMSyncOperatingCondition
	    - added opticsIMSyncProtectionUnitQualityLevel to opticsIMSyncProtectionUnitTable   
        "
	REVISION "201005130000Z"
	DESCRIPTION
      "Changes by He Zong Ying (May 2010)
	   The following scalars objects  have been added:
	   opticsIMGlobalSecEecControlEECEnable,opticsIMGlobalSecEecControlEECOption,
	   opticsIMGlobalSecEecControlSSM, opticsIMSystemClockProcessTimingMode,
	   opticsIMSystemClockProcessSwitchOperation, opticsIMSystemClockProcessSwitchToRefSource,
	   opticsIMSystemClockProcessLastOperationStatus , opticsIMSystemClockProcessRevertiveMode,
	   opticsIMSystemClockProcessWtrTimer, opticsIMSystemClockProcessOperStatus,
	   opticsIMSystemClockProcessLockedRefSource, opticsIMSystemClockProcessQL ,
	   opticsIMStationClockProcessOutputSelector, opticsIMStationClockProcessSwitchOperation,
	   opticsIMStationClockProcessSwitchToRefSource, opticsIMStationClockProcessLastOperationStatus 
	   opticsIMStationClockProcessRevertiveMode,opticsIMStationClockProcessWtrTimer,
	   opticsIMStationClockProcessOperStatus, opticsIMStationClockProcessLockedRefSource.
	   The following table objects  have been added:
	   opticsIMRefClockSourceTable, opticsIMRefClockSourcePriorityTable,
	   opticsIMOutgoingClockTable, opticsIMStationClockInterfaceTable
        "
	REVISION "201003010000Z"  
	DESCRIPTION
                "The following object are added:
			- syncQualityLevel
			- syncQualityLevelPriority
			- opticsIMAllowedSyncPhysicalInterfacesTable
                        - opticsIMSyncProtectionGroupWTRTime (opticsIMSyncProtectionGroupTable)
                 "

       REVISION "200904230000Z"
