                "New enumerated value (oneMHz) added to syncPhysicalInterfaceType.
                 "

       REVISION "200710110000Z"
      DESCRIPTION
                "New enumerated value (signalDegraded) added to opticsIMSyncProtectionUnitSwitchCriteria.
                 AsapIndex object added to opticsIMSyncProtectionUnitEntry.
